# Graveyard Trespasser (turn 3): its enters trigger exiles an Ornithopter, a creature card, so Bot2 loses 1 and Bot1 gains 1
# (20 -> 19, 20 -> 21). On turn 5 it is night and the Trespasser is Graveyard Glutton; its attack trigger takes an Ornithopter
# and a Shock, only one of them a creature card, so the drain is 1 again, not 2 for two cards (CR 608.2c). Combat deals 4:
# Bot2 19 - 1 - 4 = 14, Bot1 21 + 1 = 22; the other Ornithopter and Shock stay in the graveyard.

